mission "The Soundings of San Telmo"
    name "The Soundings of San Telmo"
    description "Sail to San Telmo and collect the pilot's new chart from Captain Ines Calderon."
    source "Cormorant Quay"
    destination "San Telmo"
    lead "Anne studies the new soundings, then marks a port on your chart. “Captain Ines Calderon is waiting at Cormorant Quay. She has been checking the Company buoys against her own soundings. I would hear her opinion before trusting any Company chart.”"
    reward 500
    speaker offer "Captain Ines Calderon"
    speaker visit "Captain Ines Calderon"
    speaker complete "Captain Ines Calderon"
    to offer
        has "The Long Blue Road: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `The magistrate needs proof that the Company is preparing to close the western convoy route.`
            `A pilot at San Telmo has found new buoys laid across the old passage. Some are false markers intended to drive ships toward hidden guns.`
            `You must carry the magistrate's warrant and compare the pilot's soundings with the official sea chart.`
            choice
                `(I will take this voyage. Tell me the course.)`
                    goto accept_job
                `(What makes this business so important?)`
                    goto more_details
                `(I have other waters to sail.)`
                    goto decline_job
            label more_details
                `You must carry the magistrate's warrant and compare the pilot's soundings with the official sea chart.`
                choice
                    `(Then I will see it done.)`
                        goto accept_job
                    `(Not this time.)`
                        goto decline_job
            label accept_job
                `Ortez seals the warrant with red wax. “A false buoy can sink more ships than a broadside. Find the truth before the next convoy sails.”`
                accept
            label decline_job
                `The officer nods and rolls the chart closed. The offer will remain here if you change your mind.`
                close
    on accept
        log "Accepted The Soundings of San Telmo. Sail to San Telmo and collect the pilot's new chart from Captain Ines Calderon."
    on visit
        conversation
            `Captain Calderon shows you the false markers and a list of Company gunboats stationed behind the reefs.`
    on complete
        conversation
            `The soundings reveal a hidden anchorage near Mariner's Rest.`
        log "Completed The Soundings of San Telmo. Received 500 gold. The soundings reveal a hidden anchorage near Mariner's Rest."
